## State Reference

| State | Behaviour |
|---|---|
| **Default** | Indigo gradient, subtle shadow |
| **Hover** | Lighter gradient, elevated shadow, lifts `1px` |
| **Active / Pressed** | Darker gradient, reduced shadow, returns to baseline |
| **Focus (keyboard)** | Visible indigo outline ring (`focus-visible` only) |
| **Disabled** | 48 % opacity, `not-allowed` cursor, no transform/shadow |
| **Loading** | Spinner replaces left icon, `aria-busy`, `wait` cursor |
| **Ripple** | Click spawns an animated ripple from the cursor position |

## Key Design Decisions

- **`focus-visible` only** — focus ring appears for keyboard users, not mouse clicks
- **`aria-busy` + `aria-label`** — screen readers announce the loading state
- **Transient props (`$`)** — styled-components v5.1+ convention to avoid forwarding custom props to the DOM
- **Ripple via DOM** — lightweight alternative to a full animation library
- **CSS `disabled` selector** — disabling is handled purely in CSS so it works even without the `isLoading` prop

