## State Reference

| State | Behaviour |
|---|---|
| **Default** | Indigo gradient, subtle shadow |
| **Hover** | Lighter gradient, elevated shadow, lifts `1px` |
| **Active / Pressed** | Darker gradient, reduced shadow, returns to baseline |
| **Focus (keyboard)** | Visible indigo outline ring (`focus-visible` only) |
| **Loading** | Spinner replaces left icon, `cursor: wait`, `aria-busy` set |
| **Disabled** | 48 % opacity, `cursor: not-allowed`, no transform or shadow |

## Key Design Decisions

- **`focus-visible` only** — focus ring appears for keyboard users, not mouse clicks
- **`aria-busy` + `aria-label`** — screen readers announce the loading state
- **Ripple on click** — DOM-injected span animated with a keyframe, cleaned up after `animationend`
- **Transient props (`$`)** — styled-components v6 convention to prevent unknown props reaching the DOM
- **Variant / size maps** — clean separation of concerns; easy to extend with new values

