## State Reference

| State | Visual Treatment |
|---|---|
| **Default** | Indigo gradient, subtle shadow |
| **Hover** | Lighter gradient, elevated shadow, `translateY(-1px)` |
| **Active / Pressed** | Darker gradient, reduced shadow, `translateY(0)` |
| **Focus-visible** | 3px indigo outline ring (keyboard only) |
| **Loading** | Content hidden, spinner shown, `cursor: wait` |
| **Disabled** | 48% opacity, grayscale tint, `cursor: not-allowed` |

## Key Design Decisions

- **Ripple effect** — DOM-injected `span` with a CSS keyframe animation; cleaned up after `animationend` to avoid memory leaks
- **Loading state** — content fades out while a spinner fades in, preserving button dimensions so the layout doesn't shift
- **Transient props** (`$size`, `$variant`, etc.) — prefixed with `$` to prevent styled-components from forwarding them to the DOM
- **Accessibility** — `aria-busy`, dynamic `aria-label`, and `:focus-visible` ring for keyboard navigation
- **Disabled + loading** — both set `disabled` on the element, preventing click handlers from firing

