## Feature Summary

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Variants** | `solid`, `outline`, `ghost` |
| **Sizes** | `sm`, `md`, `lg` |
| **Hover** | Lift + glow shadow + gradient shift |
| **Active** | Press-down transform |
| **Disabled** | Opacity + grayscale + `not-allowed` cursor |
| **Loading** | Spinner replaces left icon, `aria-busy` set, cursor `wait` |
| **Ripple** | Click-origin ripple animation |
| **Focus** | Visible focus ring for keyboard nav |
| **Icons** | Optional `leftIcon` / `rightIcon` slots |
| **Full width** | `fullWidth` prop stretches to container |
| **Accessible** | `aria-busy`, `aria-label`, `focus-visible` ring |

