## State Reference

| State | Behaviour |
|---|---|
| **Default** | Indigo gradient, subtle shadow |
| **Hover** | Lighter gradient, elevated shadow, lifts `1px` |
| **Active / Pressed** | Darker gradient, reduced shadow, returns to baseline |
| **Focus-visible** | Accessible 3 px indigo ring (keyboard only) |
| **Disabled** | `opacity: 0.45`, `cursor: not-allowed`, no transform/shadow |
| **Loading** | Spinner replaces left icon, `cursor: wait`, button disabled |
| **Ripple** | Click-origin radial burst on mouse interaction |

## Key Design Decisions

- **Transient props** (`$size`, `$variant`, etc.) prevent styled-components from forwarding non-HTML attributes to the DOM
- **`useRipple` hook** is self-contained and cleans up its own DOM nodes via `animationend`
- **`aria-busy` / `aria-label`** keep the loading state accessible to screen readers
- **`focus-visible`** ensures the focus ring only appears for keyboard navigation, not mouse clicks
- **CSS-only disabled** — no JS guards needed; the `disabled` attribute blocks all pointer events natively

