## Feature Summary

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Hover** | Darkens background, lifts with `translateY(-1px)`, adds coloured shadow |
| **Active** | Snaps back to baseline, removes shadow |
| **Disabled** | Muted grey palette, `not-allowed` cursor, `opacity: 0.7` |
| **Loading** | Animated spinner, `aria-busy`, `cursor: wait`, pointer-events blocked |
| **Ripple** | Click-origin ripple injected & self-cleaned via `animationend` |
| **Focus** | High-contrast `focus-visible` ring (keyboard-only) |
| **Variants** | `solid` · `outline` · `ghost` |
| **Sizes** | `sm` · `md` · `lg` |
| **Icons** | Optional `leftIcon` / `rightIcon` slots |
| **Accessibility** | `aria-busy`, `aria-label`, semantic `<button>`, `disabled` attribute |

