## State Reference

| State | Visual Behaviour |
|---|---|
| **Default** | Indigo background, white text |
| **Hover** | Darker shade + subtle lift (`translateY(-1px)`) + shadow |
| **Active / Pressed** | Darkest shade, no lift, ripple effect |
| **Focus-visible** | 3 px indigo outline (keyboard only) |
