| **Disabled** | Grey bg + text, `cursor: not-allowed`, no transform |

## Key Design Decisions

- **CSS custom properties** as theme tokens — easy to override per-theme
- **`$`-prefixed transient props** prevent styled-components from forwarding them to the DOM
- **Ripple effect** is injected imperatively to avoid re-renders
- **`focus-visible`** ensures the ring only appears for keyboard navigation, not mouse clicks
- **`aria-busy` + `aria-label`** keep the loading state accessible to screen readers
- **Variant × size** are fully composable with no style conflicts

