## State Reference

| State | Behaviour |
|---|---|
| **Default** | Indigo gradient, subtle shadow |
| **Hover** | Lighter gradient, elevated shadow, lifts `1px` |
| **Active / Pressed** | Darker gradient, drops back down, ripple effect |
| **Focus-visible** | Accessible indigo ring (keyboard only) |
| **Disabled** | `45 %` opacity, grayscale tint, `not-allowed` cursor |
| **Loading** | Spinner replaces left icon, `aria-busy`, `wait` cursor |

## Key Design Decisions

- **Ripple effect** — pure DOM manipulation, no extra library needed
- **`$`-prefixed props** — prevents styled-components from forwarding custom props to the DOM
- **`focus-visible`** — ring appears only for keyboard navigation, not mouse clicks
- **`aria-busy` + `aria-label`** — screen readers announce the loading state correctly
- **Variant × size matrix** — fully composable; any combination works out of the box

