## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Hover lift** | `translateY(-1px)` + shadow for tactile depth |
| **Disabled state** | `opacity: 0.48` + `cursor: not-allowed` via native `disabled` attr |
| **Loading state** | Spinner replaces icons; `aria-busy` set; cursor becomes `wait` |
| **Ripple effect** | JS-driven absolute `<span>` with CSS `scale` animation |
| **Focus ring** | `focus-visible` only — no ring on mouse click |
| **Prop forwarding** | Spreads `...rest` so `data-*`, `id`, `type` etc. pass through |
| **Transient props** | Styled-components `$` prefix prevents DOM leakage |

