## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Hover** | `translateY(-1px)` lift + gradient shift + coloured box-shadow |
| **Active** | Presses back down with `translateY(0)` + deeper colour |
| **Disabled** | `opacity: 0.48` + `grayscale(20%)` + `cursor: not-allowed` |
| **Loading** | Spinner overlay, content fades out, `aria-busy` set, pointer events blocked |
| **Focus** | `focus-visible` ring — keyboard users only, not mouse clicks |
| **Ripple** | Click-position–aware ripple with auto-cleanup after 620 ms |
| **Accessibility** | `aria-busy`, `aria-label` with loading suffix, semantic `<button>` |
| **Variants** | `solid` / `outline` / `ghost` share base styles, override via `css` map |

