| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Hover** | Lifts (`translateY(-1px)`), brightens gradient, deepens shadow |
| **Active** | Pushes down (`translateY(0)`), darkens background |
| **Disabled** | `opacity: 0.48`, `cursor: not-allowed`, `filter: grayscale(25%)`, no transform |
| **Loading** | Spinner overlay, label fades out, `cursor: wait`, `aria-busy` |
| **Focus** | Visible ring via `:focus-visible` (keyboard-only) |
| **Ripple** | Click-position ripple injected and cleaned up automatically |
| **Variants** | `solid` · `outline` · `ghost` |
| **Sizes** | `sm` · `md` · `lg` |
