## Feature Summary

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Variants** | `solid`, `outline`, `ghost` |
| **Sizes** | `sm`, `md`, `lg` |
| **Hover state** | Lift + glow shadow + lightened gradient |
| **Active state** | Pressed-down feel (translateY reset) |
| **Disabled state** | 45% opacity, `not-allowed` cursor, no transform |
| **Loading state** | Spinner overlay, hidden label, `cursor: wait` |
| **Ripple effect** | Click-position-aware ripple animation |
| **Focus ring** | Accessible `focus-visible` outline |
| **Icons** | Optional `leftIcon` / `rightIcon` slots |
| **Full width** | `fullWidth` prop stretches to container |
| **Accessibility** | `aria-busy`, `aria-disabled`, `aria-hidden` on decorative elements |

