### Feature Summary

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Hover** | Lighter gradient + elevated shadow + subtle lift (`translateY(-1px)`) |
| **Active/Press** | Darker gradient + compressed shadow + returns to baseline |
| **Disabled** | Muted palette, `not-allowed` cursor, reduced opacity, no interactions |
| **Loading** | Animated spinner, `cursor: wait`, `aria-busy`, blocks `onClick` |
| **Ripple** | Click-origin ripple effect via DOM injection + CSS animation |
| **Focus** | High-contrast `outline` for keyboard navigation |
| **Sizes** | `sm` / `md` / `lg` with proportional padding, font-size, radius |
| **Accessibility** | `aria-label`, `aria-disabled`, `aria-busy`, `role` implicit via `<button>` |
| **Icons** | Optional `leftIcon` / `rightIcon` slots, hidden during loading |

