## State & Behaviour Summary

| State | Visual Effect |
|---|---|
| **Default** | Indigo gradient, subtle shadow |
| **Hover** | Lighter gradient · lift (`translateY(-1px)`) · glow shadow |
| **Active** | Darker gradient · pressed back to baseline |
| **Focus-visible** | 3 px indigo outline ring (keyboard-safe) |
| **Disabled** | 48 % opacity · `not-allowed` cursor · no transform |
| **Loading** | Spinner replaces left icon · `aria-busy` · `wait` cursor |
| **Click** | Ripple wave emanates from pointer position |

### Key design decisions

- **`$`-prefixed transient props** (`$size`, `$variant`, etc.) prevent styled-components from forwarding custom props to the DOM.  
- **Ripple** is injected imperatively so it works for rapid repeated clicks.  
- **`aria-busy` + `aria-label`** keep the loading state accessible to screen readers.  
- **`focus-visible`** ensures the focus ring only appears for keyboard navigation, not mouse clicks.

